# Node service

Quality thresholds: **`quality-and-testing.mdc`**. API/HTTP semantics: **`api-and-events.mdc`**. Security: **`security-baseline.mdc`**. Pins: `.agents-v0/packs/node/PACK.md`.

## Source layout

A new service is NestJS under the backend root: `src/api`, `src/service`, `src/repository`, `src/domain`. TypeORM migrations live with the repository. An existing Express app keeps its layout. Do not add Nest beside Express, or `pom.xml`, or a `.csproj`.

## Shape

- Constructor injection through the Nest module. No imported singletons that hide dependencies.
- Controllers validate a DTO and call the service. Do not return entities.
- Parameterized queries only. Sort and filter fields come from an allowlist.
- Log with a structured logger. Do not log tokens, secrets, or raw PII.
- No empty catch. Methods ≤ 30 lines.
- Correlation id and `traceparent` on every request.
